Third-party / interoperability notes:

- This project's `applicationId` intentionally matches a third-party app
  ("AMap" / 高德地图, com.autonavi.minimap) in order to be granted access to a
  vivo OriginOS system API that is whitelisted by package name (see README.md).
  This license covers only the original code in this repository. It does not
  grant any rights to, and this project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
  associated with AutoNavi/AMap or vivo. Build and use at your own risk, for
  personal purposes, on your own device.

- The vivo/OriginOS SuperX protocol itself is not this project's intellectual
  property; it is documented here for interoperability and educational purposes.
